        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donna Mills, Clint Eastwood, Florence Henderson, Pam Grier\n- Works: Love Is a Many Splendored Thing, Play Misty for Me, Ladies of the House\n- Roles: Tobie Williams\n\nFacts:\n- Donna Mills starred for three years in the soap opera Love Is a Many Splendored Thing from 1967 to 1970.\n- In 1971, Play Misty for Me was released as an American psychological thriller film directed by Clint Eastwood in his directorial debut, and Clint Eastwood also starred in it.\n- In 1971, Donna Mills starred as Tobie Williams, the girlfriend of Clint Eastwood's character, in Play Misty for Me.\n- Ladies of the House stars Florence Henderson, Donna Mills, and Pam Grier.",
